# Brainfuck wide relocation patcher for five hundred twelve command slots
# Input uses a two byte count and encoded branch records
# Output contains patched slots and two zero status bytes
# The adapter verifies slot framing and bracket position ranges
# The table uses twelve cells per command and a travelling counter
# Compiled code is standard Brainfuck and does all relocation itself
